<title>USA: Checkpoint to acquire distributor in Japan.</title>
<headline>Checkpoint to acquire distributor in Japan.</headline>
<dateline>THOROFARE, N.J. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Checkpoint Systems Inc said Tuesday it signed a letter of intent to acquire its distributor Checkpoint Systems Japan Co Ltd in Japan.</p>
<p>The terms were not disclosed. Checkpoint Systems Japan has been its exclusive distributor for retail products since 1984. The acquisition is expected to be completed before December 31.</p>
<p>Checkpoint Systems, which is based in Thorofare, New Jersey, provides integrated security solutions for retailers worldwide.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
